{"type":"text","timestamp":1794235525713,"sessionID":"ses_e3f3c59d3ffekhAd65PuAwZnil","part":{"id":"prt_1c0c55ea1001xv0eowC8j5tciM","sessionID":"ses_e3f3c59d3ffekhAd65PuAwZnil","messageID":"msg_1c0c5512a001d6REuMEsqEWgW1","type":"text","text":"Implemented comprehensive fixes:\n\n- **Accurate cent conversion**: `to_cents` now uses `Decimal` for precise conversion.\n- **Rounding logic**: Updated tax and discount calculations to round half up.\n- **Invoice calculations**: Corrected `net_cents`, `tax_cents`, and `total` to apply discounts before tax and avoid double discounting.\n- **Cleaned up code**: Removed redundant return statements and fixed indentation issues.\n- **Enhanced documentation**: Added comments for clarity.\n\nAll tests should now pass successfully.","time":{"start":1794235522721,"end":1794235525713}}}
